The data contained within the /Marketplace directory is a curated, compiled dataset gathered via authorized Discord bot access. It represents significant effort and curation. While this repository is public, the data within this specific directory is not open-source.

1. PERMITTED USAGE (End Users & App Integration):
Users and third-party applications (such as the Seanime client) are granted explicit permission to fetch, read, and consume the JSON files within this directory during runtime via direct, raw URLs (e.g., raw.githubusercontent.com/Bas1874/.../Main.json). You are encouraged to link to this repository as a marketplace source.

2. PROHIBITED USAGE (Redistribution & Re-hosting):
You are STRICTLY PROHIBITED from downloading, copying, cloning, or scraping the files within the /Marketplace directory for the purpose of re-hosting them. Specifically, you may not:
- Copy the JSON files to your own GitHub repository to act as a mirror or competing marketplace endpoint.
- Host the compiled data on external servers or alternative marketplace platforms.
- Claim the curated dataset as your own work.

3. MODIFICATIONS AND CONTINUITY:
The author reserves the right to modify the dataset structure, update the contents, or completely terminate access to these files at any time without prior notice.

NOTE ON GITHUB TERMS OF SERVICE: 
While GitHub's Terms of Service grant users the technical ability to "fork" this repository, you are expressly prohibited from publishing, distributing, or utilizing the /Marketplace data from that fork to operate a public, competing Seanime marketplace. 

ENFORCEMENT: 
Any developers found illegally scraping or re-hosting this repository's proprietary JSON files to bypass access restrictions will have their plugins permanently blacklisted from this marketplace.

